<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγ-μή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spot</i> on a bird's plumage,
			Alex.Mynd. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.398d
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>brand-mark</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				34
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				5.2.1
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mathematical point</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				108b26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1174b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				427a10
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.Stoic.
				3.259
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσον ς. αἱματίνη</span> 'a
				<i>speck</i> of blood', <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				561a11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of
			anything very small, <i>jot, tittle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ γ᾽ εἶχε στιγμὴν ἢ σκιὰν τούτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.115
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				1067
			</span></i>; of time, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				29.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ς. χρόνου</span> in a
				<i>moment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				4.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. χρόνου ὁ βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.13a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.472
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ς</span>. without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				131.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγμῇ καιροῦͅ</span>,=
				<i>puncto temporis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span>. or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεία
			ς</span>. <i>full stop, period</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέση
				ς</span>. <i>colon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				630.6
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστιγμή</span>: Nicanor
			made <i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγμαί</span>, Sch.ib<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				p.24
			</span></i> H., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νικάνωρ; ς. πᾶσα σημεῖον
					αὐτοτελείας</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				182.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pron.</u>
				53.16
			</span></i>, al.</div>
